const walkthrough=[['overview','Business pulse','Start with GMV and GOS for demand, then NMV and NOS for deliveries. These streams use different event dates. Point to coverage before discussing any month total.'],['kam','Ownership and accountability','Compare KAM contribution. Click any KAM for a portfolio breakdown, or apply it as a global filter. Use KAM × Seller to identify the shop accounts behind the performance.'],['seller','Seller concentration','Review leading shop accounts and their share of GMV. Click a seller to see its top SKUs, brands and categories. Ask whether the business depends too heavily on a few partners.'],['sku','Product opportunities','Search or sort SKU performance by value, items, average order value or delivered margin. Switch to Brand and Category explorer for broader merchandising decisions.'],['operations','Execution quality','Review cancelled value and snapshot order states. Delivery lead time measures actual delivered suborders. A day’s deliveries include earlier orders, so a same-day delivered/gross ratio is not a fulfilment rate.'],['data','The daily operating rhythm','Upload the complete gross and delivered reports. Review validation, then import. Duplicate files are skipped automatically. A corrected report replaces that date’s stream after review. Export a portable dashboard to carry updated history to another device.']];
